  "verse": "You human beings of Earth in general, through your own ideas, thoughts and feelings as well as through your decisions and the free will you determine the love and hatred, the harmony and disharmony, the fairness and unfairness, the peace and war, the freedom and unfreedom as well as the fortune and unfortune; therefore raise your head and your forehead to the truthly truth and to the creational laws and recommendations so that you become knowing and wise therein, so you no longer call for a self-created terrible thing and none can befall you anymore as a result of your own doing.",
  "verseSrc": "Chapter 28, Verse 79",
  "hinge": "The cause is the **choice to keep a war supplied by an inventory that its own auditors describe as short — billions of munitions consumed in five months, interceptors more than half gone, jets and drones written off, an audit answered with the word \"treasonous\", allies therefore building their own arsenals, and non-belligerents absorbing the incursions: a drone over Moldova while a plane waited, flares at a Danish helicopter, embassies told to leave Kyiv.** Verse 79 puts the determination of peace and war exactly where it belongs — \"through your own ideas, thoughts and feelings as well as through your decisions and the free will you determine… the peace and war\" — and adds the instruction that follows from it: raise your head to the truth and to the creational laws \"so you no longer call for a self-created terrible thing\". An audit unread is still an audit; a stockpile denied is still finite; a drone crossing a neutral border is still a decision. The same law permits other causes, and each begins with a document rather than a victory: published floors for war stocks, multi-year contracts for air defence, an agreed automatic answer to airspace violations, collective European procurement, and a negotiation conducted as though the shortage were real — because it is. Whether this becomes the winter a war is supplied by generosity it cannot count and spreads across borders it never declared, or the winter its arithmetic is used to end it, is being decided in choices available now — and the effect will follow the cause that is set."
